    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d546">

                <pb facs="0646" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg558"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buchanan to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation, Special Mission</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1904-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January
                                25, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 44.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 29 of the 16th and my
                    note to the minister for foreign affairs, I beg to inclose herewith a
                    translation of a note I have received from the minister for foreign affairs with
                    regard to the subject-matter, together with a copy of the decree he refers to in
                    said note.</p>
                <p>You will be pleased, I am sure, to note that steps have been taken in the
                    direction indicated in my note to the minister.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. I. Buchanan.</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d546-a1.xml" xpointer="d546-a1"/>
